			"notes": "First release.\n\n- /music <YouTube URL> downloads a track into the jukebox library\n- Jukebox GUI (shift + right-click or /player): live progress, stop, skip, eject, loop, searchable track list, download by URL\n- Positional audio for every player within 64 blocks; joining mid-song resumes at the right point\n- Radio-style queue when loop is off\n- Opus cache with LRU size limit\n- Self-updating YouTube extractor (youtube-source), with configurable client order (youtubeClients)"
		},
